  "overview": "Every time I think of Hà Giang, that song \"Hà Giang sao mà yêu thế\" starts playing in my head, and honestly it already says most of the review.\n\nRiding a motorbike around Mã Pí Lèng, floating on the Nho Quế river, looking at the Đồng Văn karst plateau, visiting places like Pao's House and Lô Lô Chải village, all of it felt unreal in the best way. Hà Giang was not just beautiful. It was peak.",
